.Xr quark_queue_open 3 ,
.Xr quark 7 ,
.Xr quark-btf 8 ,
.Xr quark-mon 8 ,
.Xr quark-test 8
.Sh HISTORY
.Nm
appeared in quark 0.8, when times handed out by quark switched
from nanoseconds since the Unix epoch to nanoseconds since boot.
In quark 0.9 it became self-maintaining and gained nanosecond
resolution, replacing
.Fn quark_update_boottime
and
.Fn quark_time_to_wallclock .
